+    "notes": "Zenodo persistence establishes identity, persistence and public availability of the deposited bytes after successful independent redownload. It does not by itself establish physical correspondence, cosmogenesis, independent empirical confirmation, scientific consensus, PASS, FINAL_PASS or general EFFECT_ACK_DONE.",
+    "version": "1.0.0",
+    "prereserve_doi": true
+  },
